## Oh-my-claudecode's full architecture at a glance

OMC is a **28-agent, 57-skill, 20-hook orchestration platform** distributed as a Claude Code plugin (`oh-my-claude-sisyphus` on npm). Its core design principles — delegation-first orchestration, hook-driven lifecycle, session-scoped state, explicit model routing — should map directly onto Auggie's nearly identical plugin and hook APIs.

**OMC component counts vs likely OMA v0.1.4 baseline:**

| Component | OMC v4.11.x | Likely OMA v0.1.4 | Delta |
|-----------|-------------|-------------------|-------|
| Agents (subagents/*.md) | 28 unified | ~13 (user implies 15 missing) | **+15** |
| Skills (skills/*/SKILL.md) | 57+ | ~5–10 core | **+40–50** |
| Commands (commands/*.md) | 35+ | ~19 (user implies 16 missing) | **+16** |
| Hook scripts (scripts/*.mjs) | 20 across 11 events | ~5–8 basics | **+12–15** |
| Keyword triggers | 10+ | ~3 (user implies 7 missing) | **+7** |
| MCP tools (state-server) | state_read/write/clear + notepad + skill + intent | state_read/write/clear only | **+3 tool groups** |

